{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"稳定同伦范畴"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“稳定同伦范畴”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#稳定同伦论</p>\n<p>稳定同伦范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦范畴","text":"同伦范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于稳定同伦范畴中的对象 $X,Y$, 有分次态射对象 $[X,Y]_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf {Ab}^{\\mathbb{Z}}$,\n$$\r\n[X,Y]_n := [X,\\Sigma^{-n}Y].\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定∞-范畴","text":"稳定无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}